  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Identification Study for a sustainable food security project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;This action shall contribute to reinforcing food security in the Southern Neighbourhood by identifying the value added and the main components of a regional programme on sustainable food systems, referring to the four pillars of food security: availability of food, economic and physical access to food, food utilisation and stability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The identification study shall identify measures that build on and/or complement existing EU programs and instruments. These include but are not limited to the current EU rapid response to the food crisis, bilateral projects on agriculture, food systems and sustainable blue economy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The identification study shall take into account the key challenges in the sector (including environment, climate change, demography, the geopolitical situation) and the opportunities provided by donor support (bilateral, multilateral, national etc) both in terms of grants and blending or guarantees.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
